"bd6544d865d959d7ecd00cff5b4647b44b50e67c72f8216fd4b2af7cc5012f6d","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":35},{"dia_id":"D28:36","global_turn_index":519,"locator":"[S28T36]","raw_turn_sha256":"fdfcb599a61f9005e6eb94e7b8613cae84008cbacd01bd9d1ddc4bc5938a266f","rendered_turn_sha256":"43ea32b39a2252d10fe43992e51dbe32248dd377d1767a4ef5a8de728bad2613","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"8f1ebc87ca8b82783562338a2d13c63c67cc93d23100b18f826910e050112596","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":36}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Yup, it's that connection I'm aiming for with my music. Take a loot at my studio setup, that's look awesome, isn't it?\n[Image caption: a photography of a recording studio with a monitor, keyboard, and monitor]\n[S28T27] (dia_id: D28:27)\n\nDave: Wow, your studio looks stunning! How do you like hanging out here? Do you watch much TV?\n[S28T28] (dia_id: D28:28)\n\nCalvin: I only work in the studio. I have another room for relaxation with a TV, just take a look that room is cozy and relaxing. And yeah, It's a great way to unwind and get inspired.\n[Image caption: a photo of a living room with a couch, chair, television and a table]\n[S28T29] (dia_id: D28:29)\n\nDave: Wow, nice setup! What do you usually watch on it?\n[S28T30] (dia_id: D28:30)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I usually watch music videos, concerts, and documentaries about artists and their creative process. It's cool to learn more about the industry and see what others do. Plus, it's a source of inspiration for me.\n[S28T31] (dia_id: D28:31)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that's awesome! Keep up the great work! Take a look at the photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a notebook with a pen and a notepad on it]\n[S28T32] (dia_id: D28:32)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Appreciate the support! Does this notebook help you stay connected to the creative process?\n[S28T33] (dia_id: D28:33)\n\nDave: Yes, Calvin, writing lyrics and notes - that's awesome! It will boost my motivation! Writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow!\n[Image caption: a photo of a pink floyd headphone sitting on a shelf]\n[S28T34] (dia_id: D28:34)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! These really help you stay focused when making music.\n[S28T35] (dia_id: D28:35)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Music really helps me focus and be productive. When I'm doing my car stuff, I listen to vinyl to relax and stay on track.\n[S28T36] (dia_id: D28:36)","text_sha256":"5aab51283a134def3abd73d8ad376256fc5ab5edcc5d8a0467637f021f54e7e9","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D30:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S30T1]"],"text_sha256":"7197d6eb05103f1431505cf9f583ce77510f01620ea63b50114c27a6eab9329a"},{"dia_ids":["D30:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S30T2]"],"text_sha256":"38bf1f2d0a8d8da37136b814f5652ac9bd3e5cb80511dee44ec7b469ba26ce3e"},{"dia_ids":["D30:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S30T3]"],"text_sha256":"e29fd7a07d8c63cdd02907521b181206931fcf4c506d39964f67d314b12147d3"},{"dia_ids":["D30:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S30T4]"],"text_sha256":"14161632c0a069b715f5bc5a1014a63e47232a27d78c57c1de98618d39c7cc32"},{"dia_ids":["D30:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S30T5]"],"text_sha256":"0db4d7951bf775b863bda5aa4c70437dbc8268933170a8d68c33c6d930887e78"},{"dia_ids":["D30:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":32,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S30T6]"],"text_sha256":"dc5b0658b7793ee6f5373b7240fc7839626e80f4f9448569739ad35501c05e3a"},{"dia_ids":["D30:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":35,"line_start":34,"source_locators":["[S30T7]"],"text_sha256":