23-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"6cf65110f77008ef3dfb9cdeca49fe49df8fa79ad8a2e6d687e324eedea7ed8f","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":14}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Glad you're finding joy in what you do! Any strategies that help you manage everything?\n[S25T5] (dia_id: D25:5)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, having a strong support system is really helpful. My friends and team keep me on track.\n[S25T6] (dia_id: D25:6)\n\nDave: Cool! Having people who understand and support you is really important. I recently had a good conversation with some neighbors about current events and politics. It was nice to hear different perspectives and share our own. Interacting like that cheers me up and helps me stay informed - how about you?\n[S25T7] (dia_id: D25:7)\n\nCalvin: Staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to me. It helps my music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives and connects me better with my fans. Plus, it keeps me motivated and inspired.\n[S25T8] (dia_id: D25:8)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Art is amazing how it reflects the world. Has anything caught your eye lately and made an impact on your music?\n[S25T9] (dia_id: D25:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, for sure! Recently, I've been really inspired by some of the struggles that people go through. It's made me dig deeper into my music to try to capture those feelings.\n[S25T10] (dia_id: D25:10)\n\nDave: That's cool. Using your music to share experiences and feelings, is it cathartic for you?\n[S25T11] (dia_id: D25:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's a way for me to express myself and work through my emotions. It's like my own form of therapy.\n[S25T12] (dia_id: D25:12)\n\nDave: Yeah, I get it. Cars give me an outlet to express myself. It's like a little oasis of calm. Whenever I'm working on one, it's like I'm connecting back with myself. And yeah, the music helps too! Look at my garage, a little dirty, but everything is in its place.\n[Image caption: a photography of a garage with a bunch of tools hanging on the wall]\n[S25T13] (dia_id: D25:13)\n\nCalvin: Looking cool - what made you start working on cars?\n[S25T14] (dia_id: D25:14)","text_sha256":"85b5de0cab4674fccd072fedd18f33b89029d6a77a9f9610d164b5431403df38","timestamp":"2023-10-23T14:17:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":331,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":12316,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":12647},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"How does Calvin plan to jumpstart his inspiration?","question_id":"conv-50-q081","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":2,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"009fe8927eeabce19a03bedd03bdf2eb41cfd16aaae2d261307ba94125d5d632","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":4,"runtime_sha256":"693ca84094f8f85e9fe24b54d13604fa6c2f8d64e282e7b8c7e96bb88f3762d0"},"schema_version":1,"search_actions":[{"action":"search_chatrec